o rebuild his life in hiding. Through the eyes of his son who finds him again, Mengele is confronted with a past he can no longer ignore. From Buenos Aires to Paraguay via Brazil, the man who became known as “The Angel of Death” will organize his methodical disappearance to avoid any form of trial."},{"language":"de-DE","title":"Das Verschwinden des Josef Mengele","overview":"Kurz nach dem Ende des Zweiten Weltkriegs gelang Josef Mengele, dem Nazi-Arzt, der im Vernichtungslager Auschwitz praktiziert hatte, die Flucht aus Deutschland. Mit Hilfe von SS-Soldaten und der Unterstützung reicher südamerikanischer Familien tauchte er in Argentinien unter."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59u41vE8VkcaJyhcUUbYHwhXSjA.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjN54IGBAkQSr55ntraLdxBoJwr.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1037264,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59u41vE8VkcaJyhcUUbYHwhXSjA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59u41vE8VkcaJyhcUUbYHwhXSjA.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59u41vE8VkcaJyhcUUbYHwhXSjA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59u41vE8VkcaJyhcUUbYHwhXSjA.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFS1Aj5VjK6p7aVuqTcJIv4HSyU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eFS1Aj5VjK6p7aVuqTcJIv4HSyU.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFS1Aj5VjK6p7aVuqTcJIv4HSyU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eFS1Aj5VjK6p7aVuqTcJIv4HSyU.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":300